; VU1 microprogram (generated by tools/vu1/gen.py mapspec, do not edit): the map's specular / environment pass
; (Polaris 2.3, map.c spec pass): untextured gouraud triangles added over the opaque map with the same positions (GS
; ALPHA Cs x As + Cd, depth GEQUAL, no Z write: the EE sets them), one per map triangle of a chunk whose material has an
; _s map. Two entries: VU1MapSpec_CodeStart for list batches, VU1MapSpec_Idx for indexed ones (vu1mapi's layout).
; Input: header 0 {tris, cull mask, G = Schlick grazing weight of the chunk, 0}, 1 {origin xyz, step}, 2-4 the dot rows
; R_k = (Ls_k, 2 Up_k, V_k, H_k) / 127 (world space: Ls the specular light, V towards the camera from the chunk, H =
; normalize(Ls + V)), 5 (BIG, -V.Up, a, b) with max(0, a c + b)^2 ~ c^(2^k) (the chunk's roughness, as vu1skin2),
; 6 PRIM tag (gouraud, fog, blend, no texture; RGBAQ, XYZF2; NLOOP 3 + EOP); indexed: 7 {vertex passes, triangle
; stream offset}. Vertices at 7 (indexed 8), 3 qw each: s16 pos, s8 normal x 127 with .w = F0 x 127 (u8 0..127), unused.
; Constants: 0-7 as vu1map2.vsm, MAP_SPEC 1019.. (layout.py): Ec (.w 128), Eh, SpecI, (255, 255, 255, 1/127).
; Per vertex: position, fog, CLIP and screen as vu1map2; D = (n.Ls, 2 n.Up, n.V, n.H); c = n.H clamped to 0 where
; n.Ls <= 0; d = max(0, a c + b)^2; R.y = 2 (n.Up)(n.V) - V.Up; env = Ec + Eh R.y; f = F0 + G (1 - n.V)^5 (Schlick);
; colour = min(f (env + SpecI d), 255), alpha 128. Triangles: ADC as vu1map2 (flagged vertex or culled); each one its
; own GIF packet (1 + 6 qw) in output slot VI08 (994 / 1004, shared with the map programs).

; list: 183 cycles per triangle; indexed: 176 per 3 vertices, 43 per triangle (tools/vu1 timing model)

		.vu
		.align 4
		.global VU1MapSpec_CodeStart
		.global VU1MapSpec_Idx
		.global VU1MapSpec_CodeEnd
